{
  "id": "typescript-16-reflect-metadata",
  "slug": "reflect-metadata",
  "title": "reflect-metadata and design-time type information",
  "moduleId": "typescript-16-decorators-and-metadata",
  "order": 3,
  "hook": "**reflect-metadata** + **emitDecoratorMetadata** provide design:paramtypes for Nest/Angular DI — `Reflect.getMetadata(\"design:paramtypes\", target)`.",
  "sections": [
    {
      "heading": "What is this?",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "text": "Import `reflect-metadata` once at entry. **emitDecoratorMetadata** emits __metadata calls. **design:paramtypes** = constructor array for params. **Interfaces erase** — use @Inject(token). Generics often become Object."
        },
        {
          "type": "glossary",
          "title": "Key terms",
          "entries": [
            {
              "term": "reflect-metadata",
              "longForm": "polyfill",
              "plainDefinition": "Reflect.getMetadata API.",
              "example": "import \"reflect-metadata\""
            },
            {
              "term": "design:paramtypes",
              "longForm": "param types",
              "plainDefinition": "Runtime ctor fns for params.",
              "example": "Reflect.getMetadata(...)"
            },
            {
              "term": "emitDecoratorMetadata",
              "longForm": "compiler emit",
              "plainDefinition": "Metadata for decorated decls.",
              "example": "tsconfig true"
            },
            {
              "term": "inject token",
              "longForm": "@Inject()",
              "plainDefinition": "Interface params need token.",
              "example": "@Inject(USER_REPO)"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "Why does it matter?",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "text": "Nest resolves constructor deps via paramtypes. Interface injection fails without token. Security: metadata not validation."
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "variant": "tip",
          "title": "Interview trap: interface in constructor",
          "body": "constructor(private repo: IUserRepo) paramtypes useless — @Inject token required."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "How it works step by step",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "steps",
          "title": "Mental model",
          "items": [
            {
              "title": "emitDecoratorMetadata",
              "body": "true"
            },
            {
              "title": "import polyfill",
              "body": "first line main"
            },
            {
              "title": "decorate class",
              "body": "See code walkthrough and official documentation for this step."
            },
            {
              "title": "framework reads metadata",
              "body": "DI container"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "diagram",
          "diagram": {
            "type": "mermaid",
            "title": "Metadata pipeline",
            "source": "flowchart LR\n  TS --> EMIT[emitDecoratorMetadata]\n  EMIT --> META[__metadata]\n  META --> RM[reflect-metadata]\n  RM --> DI[Nest DI]"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "Code walkthrough",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "snippet",
          "snippet": {
            "language": "typescript",
            "label": "paramtypes demo",
            "code": "import \"reflect-metadata\";\nclass Repo {}\nclass Service { constructor(private r: Repo) {} }\nconst types = Reflect.getMetadata(\"design:paramtypes\", Service);\nconsole.log(types);",
            "explanation": "Shows metadata keys."
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "snippet",
          "snippet": {
            "language": "typescript",
            "label": "Inject token",
            "code": "const USER_REPO = Symbol(\"USER_REPO\");\ninterface UserRepo { find(id: string): Promise<User>; }\nclass UserService { constructor(@Inject(USER_REPO) private repo: UserRepo) {} }",
            "explanation": "Interface needs token."
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "snippet",
          "snippet": {
            "language": "typescript",
            "label": "Injectable marker",
            "code": "function Injectable() { return <T extends { new(...a: unknown[]): object }>(ctor: T) => ctor; }",
            "explanation": "DI scans ctor metadata."
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "snippet",
          "snippet": {
            "language": "typescript",
            "label": "Failure: no polyfill",
            "code": "// Reflect.getMetadata is not a function — import reflect-metadata first",
            "explanation": "Must load before decorated classes."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
